{"term": {"label": "心", "occurrences": 28, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "一", "id": "一"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "何", "id": "何"}, {"form": "口", "id": "口"}, {"form": "同", "id": "同"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "思", "id": "思"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "放", "id": "放"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "貴", "id": "貴"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.22104239490558486, "source": "心", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.5926059513380679, "source": "心", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 0.256133714716855, "source": "心", "target": "敬"}, {"weight": 0.5926059513380679, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.35621717327383756, "source": "心", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.1034315751040586, "source": "心", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 0.256133714716855, "source": "心", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 1.1034315751040586, "source": "心", "target": "同"}, {"weight": 0.4102843945441133, "source": "心", "target": "口"}, {"weight": 1.9789003124579585, "source": "心", "target": "放"}, {"weight": 0.8157495026522776, "source": "心", "target": "一"}, {"weight": 0.5926059513380679, "source": "心", "target": "失"}, {"weight": 1.5088966832122228, "source": "心", "target": "求"}, {"weight": 0.8157495026522776, "source": "心", "target": "思"}, {"weight": 0.5926059513380679, "source": "心", "target": "貴"}, {"weight": 1.7644904411125035, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.1403361320395096, "source": "義", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 0.0905140075408319, "source": "義", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 0.6013396313068224, "source": "義", "target": "口